							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1541.msg16696#msg16696">Quote from: Sanda on April 29, 2005, 05:49:59 pm</a></div><div class="quote"> Meaning, he recruited and tried to earn double points as a boxed toon. The person that remained in the guild knew all this was going on and didn&#039;t say anything so she was on thin ice as it was.</div>I&#039;d have booted her at this point already. Very fluffy of you not to, and someone must have realized the eventual outcome.</td>
