							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1541.msg16683#msg16683">Quote from: Shrek on April 29, 2005, 08:16:34 am</a></div><div class="quote">Your formula has typo Del, the matrix has just fallen apart... <br /></div>Oh shit.<br />Edited before too much harm was done.</td>
