								&nbsp;<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php#1">General Category</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?board=1.0">General Discussion</a> / <a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1541.15#msg16640">Re: random thoughts on strats</a>
							</td>
							<td align="right" style="padding: 0 1ex; white-space: nowrap;">
