						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">Yeap :P<br /><br />Thanks man. Rather unbelievable that we got it first really. I mean we have REALLY good rogues and shit, but we didn&#039;t put in all that much time. We tried Ragnaros like 4 times before the patch, then for 6 days after the patch (and 2h per run basically). Considering how many people play this game, I&#039;d have expected someone to have done what we did and not had the minor things going wrong that we had for the last two days.<br /><br />Still, a pretty badass fight and a great experience :P</td>
