							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16550#msg16550">Quote from: Toastie on April 19, 2005, 05:53:22 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Crimson Tempest killed Barxt and Noqufiel within days of Ascent as i remember it...granted it was a long time ago, and i could of course be wrong, but i know for a fact that CT was within the top 10 guilds serverwide to kill each and we weren&#039;t terribly far behind you.</div>Yeah I wouldn&#039;t really know. I know there were a few guilds before us, and that we found the M&#039;Shas incredibly easy when we first got there. They got beefed some a few times, but still remained 6mannable. Of course we didn&#039;t 6man originally due to everyone wanting to be there, but it happened real soon during the finnish times at like 6am pst (with pretty much only euros at the kills).</td>
