						<tr>
							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left">We had Qvic molds cost dkp and quick raids be dkp. Never caused any issues for us. And we 6manned those bastards way before anyone posting on this board saw the damn zone (including anyone from Quellious), so not like we 40manned them all the time or something. We just had honest people who always reported what had been done, who got what etc. They got their dkp and the people that got items paid the price.<br /><br />And you don&#039;t need MQ to get to them quickly unless you&#039;re really stupid and inept. ESPECIALLY not if you had level 70 when you went for them.</td>
