							<td height="50" colspan="3" valign="top" class="windowbg2" align="left"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg16383#msg16383">Quote from: Calidiel on April 12, 2005, 12:15:58 pm</a></div><div class="quote">Heh.. i didnt know there were Cragbeasts in any expansion other than GoD... and we had a former Ascent member say that you guys never killed her Del.  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wiggle2.gif" alt="Wiggle" border="0" /></div>Well I have no idea what what are in OoW or DoN... might have had more cragbeasts for all I know!<br /><br />Anyway there are Ascent members and Ascent members. Lots of people got recruited after the core went to WoW beta like june 2004, and as far as I know Cragbeast never got killed once the core had left. So those that got recruited after we had left would probably have no idea that we killed it before. Pretty much all the members of Ascent I know are still playing EQ1 are in &lt;Assent&gt; these days, with some in &lt;Triton&gt;. Only ones I can name that would get direct guildinvites to the WoW guild are Aellis, Fysts and Vayanla.<br /><br />Anyway yes we killed cragbeast roughly 1 year ago with about 35 people. Admittedly it was pretty far from flawless.</td>
